AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pure note normalizer, write planner, and stage preview model[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]note-writer[dim] · [dim][/dim]after note-caption[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]note-writer: add the pure bankNoteNormalize, bankNoteWritePlan (with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]round-trip self-check), and bankNoteStagePreview helpers plus their test[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]matrix; ordered after note-caption only to serialize bob-plugins builds [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and vault syncs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Space keymap, in-card note stage, stay-on-row commit, command,[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]and docs[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]note-stage[dim] · [dim][/dim]after note-writer[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]note-stage: reassign Space to the note stage and `-` to no-category, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]build the in-card stage and bankNoteCommit that never advances, add [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`Bank: note this row`, update e2e, plugin and bob-cli docs, and apply [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory only per the decisions.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-oo","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-oo.2","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub","wait_for_beads":["bob-cli-oo.1"]},"source_run_id":"run-99c52484acc51dccdb2f4ca7654eb1a3","started_at":"2026-11-21T18:46:43.156924+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"2a66752f05b45284a4c3bc729a1cfc86847430d4bf4ed8938f220b6211f83f6b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-oo.3--2/chat.md","size_bytes":19047},"commits":{"digest":"7bc